      "page": 178,
      "inShort": "Area bounded by y = f(x), X-axis, x = a, x = b is A = ∫_a^b |y| dx. Area between two curves y = f(x) and y = g(x) (where f(x) ≥ g(x)): A = ∫_a^b [f(x) − g(x)] dx.",
